<title>USA: Ahmanson set back in court - Great Western.</title>
<headline>Ahmanson set back in court - Great Western.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Western Financial Corp on Friday said H.F. Ahmanson's application for expedited treatment of a motion to force a May 6 annual meeting of Great Western was denied by the Delaware Chancery Court.</p>
<p>Ahmanson is currently trying to acquire Great Western in a hostile takeover bid. Great Western has chosen instead to seek a friendly deal with Washington Mutual Inc.</p>
<p>Earlier, Great Western said it planned to hold its annual meeting on June 13.</p>
</text>
